### Probar Login
POST http://localhost:8081/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ricardo@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Registrar Nuevo Usuario
POST http://localhost:8081/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ricardo Gómez",
  "email": "ricardo@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "rol": "admin"
}

### Generar Factura
POST http://localhost:8084/facturas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cliente_id": 201,
  "usuario_id": 1,
  "productos": [
    { "id": 101, "cantidad": 1 },
    { "id": 102, "cantidad": 2 }
  ]
}